---
layout: layouts/list.njk
title: Fanzin Archive
description: Browse all issues of our weekly publication
permalink: /fanzins/
---
<p style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
  Our "mini weekly newspaper" distributed in English. Leave copies in restaurants, cafes, schools,
  or any place where you think people might read it.
</p>

<ul class="archive-list">
{% for fanzin in collections.fanzins %}
  <li class="archive-item">
    <h3><a href="{{ fanzin.url }}">{{ fanzin.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="card-meta">{{ fanzin.data.date | dateFormat }}</p>
    <p class="card-description">{{ fanzin.data.description }}</p>
    {% if fanzin.data.pdfUrl %}
    <a href="{{ fanzin.data.pdfUrl }}" class="btn" style="margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);">Download PDF</a>
    {% endif %}
  </li>
{% endfor %}
</ul>
